

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.souza@example.com",
  "password": "ana@1234567",
  "name":"ana",
  "lastname": "souza"
}

### Authenticate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ana.souza@example.com",
  "password": "ana@1234567"
}

